{
 "id": "District",
 "notes": [
  "Set metres: the main tower's front column line is Y = 0 (its face looks out along -Y), X runs along that face with column C1 at X = 0, Z up from the tower's foot.",
  "Measured on the Breakout shot (calibration/stereo.py, orthophoto.py) in solve units of 11 m: bays 0.747 (8.2 m), storeys 0.38 (4.18 m), columns 0.08 square; she breaks out of storey 18 through the bay left of C1.",
  "The sky's cumulus are a volume (its clouds: CIN.Clouds.Deck) 600-1300 m up over 12 km round the district, lit by the set's sun in their own shading; crows (CIN.Birds.Flock) wheel round the tower where she breaks out and wider over the district.",
  "The tower is 26 storeys under its roof (108.7 m): Breakout's camera sees its face up to 95 m, never its top; the hand shot sees the roof edge at the lower left.",
  "Round the tower stands the district's high-rise (CIN.City.Field, blocks 45-140 m, clear within 72 m of the tower) and, past its right end along its face, the skeletal Annex: Breakout's frame 180 sees its top 114 m up some 80 m away (its storeys 65 px apart) and everything else in the picture above 76 m.  The breach throws dust -- a cloud that billows out of the bay, hangs before the face and drifts along it towards +X (Breach Cloud, from frame 96: Breakout's camera hovers 4 m in front of the breach and the reference keeps it at the left of the picture, growing), and the streak she drags out with her (Breach Trail) and debris (Breach Debris, Falling Debris); dust fills the storey behind the glass before it (Room Dust).",
  "The district's air is hazy low down (CIN.Air: 0.0025 per metre at the ground, thinning to 1/e every 140 m): Breakout's far towers fade, the hand shot's sky overhead stays clear.",
  "Above the breach storey the tower is its front frame alone (Tower Crown, storeys 19-26: columns, edge beams and braces, no floors, no mullions, roof 108.7 m up): from frame 116 on the reference shows sky through big braces over her, while the breach storey keeps its mullions and the floor over it (frames 76-92).",
  "What the breach throws into the air is shown only while Breakout looks at it (frames up to 206): the hand shot that cuts in at 207 shows clear sky and crows.",
  "Round her after the breach (the hand and flight shots, frames 200-379) a flock wheels close by (Crows Round: headings all round, 2-20 m from her), as the reference's crows cross the lens.",
  "Inside the tower's frame below its crown stands its dark core (Tower Core, set 2.5 m back from the face): the reference sees a dark interior through the facade (frames 76-92), never the sky through the building.",
  "The bay she breaks out through (storey 18, between x -8.2 and 0.0) is left open in the tower and stands as a panel of its own (Breach Panel: its braces and mullions, inside ghosts of the tower's own column and beams) until the frame before she breaks it (95); its pieces are the Breach Debris.",
  "Before she breaks out the sill of the breach smokes: small grey puffs on the edge beam of its floor, 4-7 m from the camera, between x -5 and -1.8 (Ledge Dust, frames 68-100), where the reference's puffs on 76-94 lie on the facade's plane.",
  "What the breach throws is mostly shards and slabs of pale concrete and glass, a few chunks among them (Breach Debris, Falling Debris: color:debris 0.75, seven in ten flat, two thousand of them a hand across and smaller), as the reference's pieces glint grey against the sky; thrown fast and slowed by the air (Breach Debris: 14 m/s, a third of a second to slow), they streak out of the breach and hang round her, sinking slowly.",
  "The sun lights the set (lighting: set); her own key (Key: the sun's direction and colour, lighting her alone) is as strong as each shot's reference shows her skin lit (the shots' lights, calibration/fit_skin.py): under the set's sun her toon-shaded skin clips white."
 ],
